    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Arlette, tu es là?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Arlette, are you there?' Gabriel asks as he looks into her office.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "arlette",
      "t": "Hein, qu'est-ce qui se passe?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Huh, what is going on?' Arlette looks up surprised from her paperwork.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Je te cherchais partout ici.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was looking everywhere for you here.' Gabriel explains he has been roaming the agency corridors.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "arlette",
      "t": "Tu as l'air très nerveux.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You look very nervous.' Arlette observes his visible anxiety immediately.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Les choses changent vite maintenant.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Things are changing fast now.' Gabriel hints at the turbulent shifts taking place at ASK.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "arlette",
      "t": "L'agence a connu des tempêtes.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The agency has weathered storms before.' Arlette recalls her decades of experience in the agency business.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Tu resterais toujours avec nous?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Would you still stay with us?' Gabriel tests whether she would follow them if they leave.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "arlette",
      "t": "Je reste fidèle à mes amis.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I remain loyal to my friends.' Arlette states her core personal principle.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Andréa et moi comptons sur toi.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Andrea and I count on you.' Gabriel emphasizes the close bond between the three agents.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "arlette",
      "t": "Ne fais pas de bêtises, Gabriel.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not do anything foolish, Gabriel.' Arlette cautions him with maternal intuition.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Nous voulons simplement nous protéger.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We simply want to protect ourselves.' Gabriel defends their motives for acting behind Hicham's back.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "arlette",
      "t": "La loyauté est essentielle ici.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Loyalty is essential here.' Arlette underscores the foundational virtue of their profession.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Merci pour ta sagesse, Arlette.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for your wisdom, Arlette.' Gabriel appreciates her steadying presence.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "arlette",
      "t": "Garde ton calme aujourd'hui.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
